nd Scales, ambitious bureaucrat<br /> Nellens Malakai - Aspect Book Fire - notable sorcerer, minor Nellens celebrity,<br /> Cynis Denovah Avaku - Aspect Book Fire - Doubting Shikari of the Wyld Hunt, notable young Legion officer<br /> Sesus Rafara - Aspect Book Fire - Assassin and master spy<br /> Sesus Taikona - Aspect Book Fire - Dedicated diplomat, brought Valis into the Realm<br /> V'neef Bijar - Aspect Book Fire - Least favorite daughter of V'neef,<br /> Sesus Chenow Lahor - Aspect Book Fire - Realm commander and rapist, stationed in the Northeast<br /> Sesus Chenow Tessani - Aspect Book Fire - Next in line for rulership of the Chenow line of house Sesus<br /> Senator Cathak Cacek Matarin - Aspect Book Fire - Aging realm senator, major player in house Cathak's political strategy<br /> Sesys Magel Kenruyo - Aspect Book Fire - Noted sorcerer-surgeon, innovator<br /> Sesus Magel Talor - Aspect Book Fire - Self-Interested uncle to Kenruyo<br /> <b>Sesus Magel Alon - Aspect Book Fire - Self-Interested aunt to Kenruyo</b><br /> Cynis Takgana - Aspect Book Earth - Member of the Iron Horses, itinerant monk, member of the Immaculate Order. One-time betrothed to Peleps Dekna<br /> Peleps Dekna -Aspect Book Earth - Noted Anathema of the Solar Exalted<br /> Crow - Aspect Book Earth - Outcaste instructor at Pasiap's Stair<br /> Ragara Jasir - Aspect Book Earth - Skilled manipulator and spymaster<br /> Moias - Aspect Book Earth - Realm Magistrate<br /> Imminent Thunder - Aspect Book Earth - Ancient Immaculate Master, Wyld Hunt Shikari<br /> Dutiful Sparrow - Aspect Book Earth - Sorceress, Outcaste and demon-hunter<br /> Cynis Janism - Aspect Book Earth - Cynis reformer, Vintner<br /> Ledaal Chiska - Aspect Book Earth - Sorceress and worshipper of Autochthon<br /> Ragara Myrrun - Aspect Book Earth - Grandson of Ragara</div> </div> </div> </div>Small correction, Sesus Alon is not a member of the Magel branch of House Sesus. She's actually mistress of her own household, an older branch that is heavily involved in Deliberative politics. Everything else seems right at a glance though!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1564-shinjo","name":"Shinjo","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"234"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-24T19:59:37-07:00","id":1083283,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Shinjo</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1083055-compiling-a-list-of-canon-dynasitic-dragon-blooded?p=1083247#post1083247\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Small correction, Sesus Alon is not a member of the Magel branch of House Sesus. She's actually mistress of her own household, an older branch that is heavily involved in Deliberative politics. Everything else seems right at a glance though!</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> ...<br /> <br /> Well damn.<br /> <br /> Now I'm impressed.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Need some Tunes for your Exalted Game? <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1071249-exalted-tunes\" target=\"_blank\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/m...-exalted-tunes</a><br /> Want some help managing your PCs? <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/882498-new-anathema-character-management-anathema-reincarnated\" target=\"_blank\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/m...a-reincarnated</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2442-arian-dynas","name":"Arian Dynas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2442_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"325"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-24T21:29:24-07:00","id":1083335,"title":"","content":"At this point I'm calling it a night. Updated a lot of info based on the content in MoEP: Dragon-Blooded and have the number of Dynasts up to almost 150. If anybody wants to continue where I left off it was MoEP: Dragon-Blooded page 45 with House Sesus.<br /> <br /> If anyone can think of any useful fields to add it would be welcome. I'm currently using &quot;Name&quot; &quot;Source&quot; &quot;Description&quot; &quot;Aspect&quot; &quot;House&quot; and &quot;Location&quot;<br /> Pipe dream for this project may include a map featuring the Locations one might expect to find given DB's and their Holdings, so location is nice to have.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/151-hark","name":"Hark","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar151_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"932"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-25T00:47:59-07:00","id":1083377,"title":"","content":"This is a *glorious* resource. if I ever truly get to run my Blessed Isle game, this will be an invaluable document to me. I mean its a 150 ready NPCs to build a Dynastic epic around.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>May you live in interesting times...</i><br /> <br /> Storyteller of <b><a href=\"https://sunforgedoath.obsidianportal.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Sun Forged Oath</a></b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1998-keichiokami","name":"Keichiokami","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1998_4.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"303"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-25T17:13:22-07:00","id":1083753,"title":"","content":"Well, heading into final projects and finals for the semester, so I won't be able to devote all that much time to this. However, 150 in a day is a very solid start, and the project is still open for anyone to contribute if they want.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/151-hark","name":"Hark","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar151_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"932"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-26T04:00:21-07:00","id":1083908,"title":"","content":"I added the Wyld Hunt of the Office of Harmony from the appendix of Cult of the Illuminated onto the bottom of your list. They're an interesting bunch, in my opinion the best part of that book.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer for Exalted.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2093-crumplepunch","name":"Crumplepunch","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2093_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1976"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-28T11:30:59-07:00","id":1085086,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Shinjo</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1083055-compiling-a-list-of-canon-dynasitic-dragon-blooded?p=1083247#post1083247\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Small correction, Sesus Alon is not a member of the Magel branch of House Sesus. She's actually mistress of her own household, an older branch that is heavily involved in Deliberative politics. Everything else seems right at a glance though!</div> </div> </div> </div>When/If I get my hands on that Aspect Book: Fire I'll review the section and see if there isn't 2 characters going by the name Alon.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/151-hark","name":"Hark","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar151_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"932"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-28T13:30:58-07:00","id":1085124,"title":"","content":"Finished off Manual of Exalted Power: Dragon-Blooded. Moving on to Compass of Celestial Directions: The Blessed Isle. This one should be a wealth of info on characters.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/151-hark","name":"Hark","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar151_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"932"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-28T19:09:13-07:00","id":1085278,"title":"","content":"Finally found some really conflict in characters. MoEP<img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" />ragon-Blooded and CoCD Vol.1: The Blessed Isle present two different Paragon's of Pasiap in the Immaculate Order. Will have to figure out what to do with that one.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/151-hark","name":"Hark","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar151_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"932"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-02T21:52:59-07:00","id":1087009,"title":"","content":"Put in some more time, and bumped the number of characters up to 220. Started adding mortals and other non-dragon-blooded characters of note, mostly mortal governors Still going through the Blessed Isle, lots of characters and details in that book.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/151-hark","name":"Hark","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar151_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"932"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-18T11:25:40-07:00","id":1094234,"title":"","content":"With finals over, I finished up The Blessed Isles bringing the total a significant Realm characters up to 240. Probably going to move on to the 1e Dragon-Blooded book, though that should just involve filling out details in otherwise blank entries.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.